| 3.5.8→4.0.0 | management.metrics.mongodb.command.enabled | true | Whether to enable Mongo client command metrics. |
| 3.5.8→4.0.0 | management.metrics.mongodb.connectionpool.enabled | true | Whether to enable Mongo connection pool metrics. |
| 3.5.8→4.0.0 | management.metrics.observations.ignored-meters |  | Meters that should be ignored when recoding observations. |
