## Camel変更一覧

| ID | 版区間 | 種別 | 優先度(目安) | 区分(自動分類・目安) | 対象コンポーネント | 見出し(公式ガイド原文) | ソース調査の観点 | 調査キーワード(原文のコード表記から抽出) | 概要(原文冒頭) | 他の版区間にも同見出しあり | 原文全文(公式ガイド) | 調査結果 | メモ(該当箇所・対応方針) |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| C001 | 4.14→4.15 | マイナー | 高 | オプション/クラス/API名・形式の変更 | (全般/その他) | Data Formats | 旧名称(オプション名・クラス名・ヘッダー名・XML/YAML属性)を grep し、新名称へ置換。XML/YAML DSL は属性形式の変更もあるため route ファイルも対象 | header, List<String>, String, typeFilter, List, tidyMarkup | The data formats has been refactored to ensure their options are consistent and can be mapped from the DSL to their implementation using reflection-free configurers. A few data formats has therefore changed some option names: \|**Data Format** \|**Old Name** \|**New Name** \|crypto\|algorithmParameterRef\|algorithmParameterSpec \|crypto\|keyRef\|key \|crypto\|initVectorRef\|initVector \|csv\|formatRef\|format \|csv\|formatName\|format \|flatpack\|parserFactoryRef\|parserFactory \|jaxb\|namespacePrefixRef\|namespacePref |  | The data formats has been refactored to ensure their options are consistent and can be mapped from the DSL<br>to their implementation using reflection-free configurers. A few data formats has therefore changed some option names:<br><br>\|===<br>\|**Data Format** \|**Old Name** \|**New Name**<br>\|crypto\|algorithmParameterRef\|algorithmParameterSpec<br>\|crypto\|keyRef\|key<br>\|crypto\|initVectorRef\|initVector<br>\|csv\|formatRef\|format<br>\|csv\|formatName\|format<br>\|flatpack\|parserFactoryRef\|parserFactory<br>\|jaxb\|namespacePrefixRef\|namespacePrefix<br>\|soap\|namespacePrefixRef\|namespacePrefix<br>\|soap\|elementNameStrategyRef\|elementNameStrategy<br>\|swiftMx\|readConfigRef\|readConfig<br>\|swiftMx\|writeConfigRef\|writeConfig<br>\|xmlSecurity\|keyOrTrustStoreParametersRef\|keyOrTrustStoreParameters<br>\|===<br><br>And in XML DSL the csv dataformat have changed `header` from a `List<String>` to be a single `String`<br>where the header values are separated by comma. This is more tooling friendly and also how other components<br>and dataformats are configured.<br><br>For example:<br><br>[source,xml]<br>[code]<br>    <csv format="EXCEL" delimiter="\|" skipHeaderRecord="true"><br>      <header>orderId</header><br>      <header>amount</header><br>    </csv><br><br>Should be changed to:<br><br>[source,xml]<br>[code]<br>    <csv format="EXCEL" delimiter="\|" skipHeaderRecord="true" header="orderId,amount"/><br><br>Likewise in XML DSL the YAML data format has changed `typeFilter` from a `List`> to be a single `String`<br>where the types values are separated by comma. This is more tooling friendly and also how other components<br>and dataformats are configured.<br><br>[source,xml]<br>[code]<br>    <yaml id="yaml-type-constructor-strdef" library="SnakeYAML"><br>        <typeFilter value="org.apache.camel.component.snakeyaml.model.TestPojo"/><br>        <typeFilter value="org.apache.camel.component.snakeyaml.model.Rex.*" type="regexp"/><br>    </yaml><br><br>Should be changed to:<br><br>[source,xml]<br>[code]<br>    <yaml id="yaml-type-constructor-strdef" library="SnakeYAML"<br>          typeFilter="org.apache.camel.component.snakeyaml.model.TestPojo,org.apache.camel.component.snakeyaml.model.Rex.*"/><br><br>Removed the `tidyMarkup` DataFormat in the DSL as the implementation has been removed in earlier version,<br>but we forgot to remove it from the DSL model. | 未調査 |  |
| C002 | 4.14→4.15 | マイナー | 高 | 削除 | camel-netty, camel-netty-http | camel-netty / camel-netty-http | pom/gradle の依存、URIスキーム(例: xxx:)、import、DSL要素を grep。代替先が記載されていれば置換計画を立てる | camel-netty, camel-netty-http, keyStoreFile, trustStoreFile, keyStoreResource, trustStoreResources, file: | Removed deprecated options `keyStoreFile` and `trustStoreFile`. Use `keyStoreResource` and `trustStoreResources` instead, and prefix the value with `file:` as documented. |  | Removed deprecated options `keyStoreFile` and `trustStoreFile`. Use `keyStoreResource` and `trustStoreResources` instead,<br>and prefix the value with `file:` as documented. | 未調査 |  |
| C003 | 4.14→4.15 | マイナー | 高 | オプション/クラス/API名・形式の変更 | (全般/その他) | Camel AI Nested Headers classes | 旧名称(オプション名・クラス名・ヘッダー名・XML/YAML属性)を grep し、新名称へ置換。XML/YAML DSL は属性形式の変更もあるため route ファイルも対象 |  | There were a number of nested headers classes in the camel-ai components that have been separated into a standalone Headers class. The original class and the corresponding new class are listed below. For more information, the related issue is CAMEL-22334. \|**Original Class** \|**New Class** \| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.chat.LangChain4jChat.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.chat.LangChain4jChatHeaders \| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.embeddings.LangChain4jEmbeddi |  | There were a number of nested headers classes in the camel-ai components that have been separated into a standalone Headers class.     The original class and the corresponding new class are listed below.<br>For more information, the related issue is CAMEL-22334.<br><br>\|===<br>\|**Original Class** \|**New Class**<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.chat.LangChain4jChat.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.chat.LangChain4jChatHeaders<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.embeddings.LangChain4jEmbeddings.Headers\| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.embeddings.LangChain4jEmbeddingsHeaders<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.embeddingstore.LangChain4jEmbeddingStore.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.embeddingstore.LangChain4jEmbeddingStoreHeaders<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.milvus.Milvus.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.milvus.MilvusHeaders<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.neo4j.Neo4jConstants.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.neo4j.Neo4jHeaders<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.qdrant.Qdrant.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.qdrant.QdrantHeaders<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.pinecone.PineconeVectorDb.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.pinecone.PineconeVectorDbHeaders<br>\| org.apache.camel.component.weaviate.WeaviateVectorDb.Headers \| org.apache.camel.component.weaviate.WeaviateVectorDbHeaders<br>\|===<br><br>org.apache.camel.component.langchain4j.web.search.LangChain4jWebSearchEngine.Headers was empty and has been removed | 未調査 |  |
| C004 | 4.14→4.15 | マイナー | 低 | 追加/機能拡張・ライブラリ更新(参考) | camel-mdc | camel-mdc | 参考情報。ただしライブラリのメジャー更新を含む場合は原文で破壊的変更の有無を確認 | camel-mdc, camel-mdc | We have introduced a new component, `camel-mdc`, whose goal is to simplify the usage of logging MDC (Mapped Diagnostic Context) by allowing the user to configure the Exchange headers and properties to use to trace in MDC logging format. |  | We have introduced a new component, `camel-mdc`, whose goal is to simplify the usage of logging MDC (Mapped Diagnostic Context) by allowing the user to configure the Exchange headers and properties to use to trace in MDC logging format. | 未調査 |  |
| C005 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | (全般/その他) | EIPs | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | validate, .end(), setBody, transform | The `validate` EIP in Java DSL has changed avoid having to use `.end()` to correctly continue building the route. Other EIPs such as `setBody` and `transform` does not require to use `.end()` and as such we are making this the same behavior. For example if stacking multiple validates then you would have to end `.end()` each time: Should now be: |  | The `validate` EIP in Java DSL has changed avoid having to use `.end()` to correctly continue building the route.<br>Other EIPs such as `setBody` and `transform` does not require to use `.end()` and as such we are making this the same behavior.<br><br>For example if stacking multiple validates then you would have to end `.end()` each time:<br><br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>        .validate(body().isNotNull()).end()<br>        .validate(body().isInstanceOf(String.class)).end()<br>        .validate(body().isGreaterThan("0")).end()<br><br>Should now be:<br><br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>        .validate(body().isNotNull())<br>        .validate(body().isInstanceOf(String.class))<br>        .validate(body().isGreaterThan("0")) | 未調査 |  |
| C006 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-core | camel-core | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-core, tryConvertTo, ModelToYAMLDumper, ModelToXMLDumper, boolean sourceLocation, dumpModelAsYaml | The `tryConvertTo` method in Camel type converters will no longer in case of no converter suitable, mark this as a _miss_ for any same future converter attempts to immediately be identified as a _miss_. The `ModelToYAMLDumper` and `ModelToXMLDumper` has added `boolean sourceLocation` as parameter to the 2nd `dumpModelAsYaml` methods. | あり | The `tryConvertTo` method in Camel type converters will no longer in case of no converter suitable,<br>mark this as a _miss_ for any same future converter attempts to immediately be identified as a _miss_.<br><br>The `ModelToYAMLDumper` and `ModelToXMLDumper` has added `boolean sourceLocation` as parameter to the 2nd<br>`dumpModelAsYaml` methods. | 未調査 |  |
| C007 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 高 | セキュリティ強化(挙動変更) | camel-as2 | camel-as2 | 該当コンポーネントを使用しているか grep。使用していれば、拒否される入力・必要な追加オプションがないか原文で確認し、結合テストで検証 | camel-as2, camel-as2 | This component has been improved to better support using different security algorithms isolated per context-path but sharing the same server port. If you use `camel-as2` then consider testing that everything is still working as expected when upgrading. | あり | This component has been improved to better support using different security algorithms isolated per context-path<br>but sharing the same server port. If you use `camel-as2` then consider testing that everything is still working as expected when upgrading. | 未調査 |  |
| C008 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-kamelet | camel-kamelet | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-kamelet | The kamelet component is now parsing endpoint parameters using _raw mode_ to ensure when using sensitive parameters such as access keys, passwords etc. they are not URI encoded. | あり | The kamelet component is now parsing endpoint parameters using _raw mode_ to ensure when using sensitive parameters<br>such as access keys, passwords etc. they are not URI encoded. | 未調査 |  |
| C009 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-graphql | camel-graphql | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-graphql, camel-graphql, org.apache.camel.http.base.HttpOperationFailedException, throwExceptionOnFailure=false | The `camel-graphql` component now includes Camel message headers as HTTP headers when calling the remote Graphql server. If the response is not success (2xx) then the component now throws the `org.apache.camel.http.base.HttpOperationFailedException`. This can be turned off by setting `throwExceptionOnFailure=false`. |  | The `camel-graphql` component now includes Camel message headers as HTTP headers when calling the remote Graphql server.<br><br>If the response is not success (2xx) then the component now throws the `org.apache.camel.http.base.HttpOperationFailedException`.<br>This can be turned off by setting `throwExceptionOnFailure=false`. | 未調査 |  |
| C010 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-infinispan | camel-infinispan | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-infinispan, queryBuilder, camel-infinispan, org.infinispan.query.dsl.QueryFactory | The `queryBuilder` option on `camel-infinispan` endpoint has been migrated to no longer use the deprecated query factory `org.infinispan.query.dsl.QueryFactory` to the new query API that is based on ickle query syntax. This means old code such: ._Java-only: old Infinispan query factory API_ Should use the ickle query syntax: | あり | The `queryBuilder` option on `camel-infinispan` endpoint has been migrated to no longer use the deprecated query factory<br>`org.infinispan.query.dsl.QueryFactory` to the new query API that is based on ickle query syntax.<br><br>This means old code such:<br><br>._Java-only: old Infinispan query factory API_<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>        private InfinispanQueryBuilder continuousQueryBuilder<br>                = qf -> qf.from(User.class).having("name").like("CQ%").build();<br><br>Should use the https://infinispan.org/docs/stable/titles/query/query.html#ickle-query-language[ickle] query syntax:<br><br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>        private InfinispanQueryBuilder continuousQueryBuilder<br>                = qf -> qf.query("FROM sample_bank_account.User WHERE name LIKE 'CQ%'"); | 未調査 |  |
| C011 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-jbang | camel-jbang | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-jbang, camel-launcher, edit | The `camel-launcher` binary no longer include the `edit` plugin commands. | あり | The `camel-launcher` binary no longer include the `edit` plugin commands. | 未調査 |  |
| C012 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 高 | 削除 | camel-milo | camel-milo | pom/gradle の依存、URIスキーム(例: xxx:)、import、DSL要素を grep。代替先が記載されていれば置換計画を立てる | camel-milo, ServerCertificateValidator, org.eclipse.milo.opcua.stack.core.security.CertificateValidator, CertificateValidator, DataValueListener, OpcUaMonitoredItem, DataValue | The camel-milo component has been upgraded to use Eclipse Milo 1.0.5, which includes several breaking API changes: The certificate validation API has been refactored in Milo 1.0.5: * The `ServerCertificateValidator` class has been removed * Use `org.eclipse.milo.opcua.stack.core.security.CertificateValidator` instead * The new `CertificateValidator` is located in the core security package rather than the server-specific package If you were programmatically configuring certificate validators, you |  | The camel-milo component has been upgraded to use Eclipse Milo 1.0.5, which includes several breaking API changes:<br><br>## Certificate Validation API Changes<br><br>The certificate validation API has been refactored in Milo 1.0.5:<br><br>* The `ServerCertificateValidator` class has been removed<br>* Use `org.eclipse.milo.opcua.stack.core.security.CertificateValidator` instead<br>* The new `CertificateValidator` is located in the core security package rather than the server-specific package<br><br>If you were programmatically configuring certificate validators, you need to update your code:<br><br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    // Old API (no longer works)<br>    import org.eclipse.milo.opcua.stack.server.security.ServerCertificateValidator;<br>    server.setCertificateValidator(serverCertificateValidator);<br>    <br>    // New API (Milo 1.0.5)<br>    import org.eclipse.milo.opcua.stack.core.security.CertificateValidator;<br>    server.setCertificateValidator(certificateValidator);<br><br>## Subscription Monitoring API Changes<br><br>The monitored item data value listener API has changed:<br><br>* The `DataValueListener` now requires two parameters: `OpcUaMonitoredItem` and `DataValue`<br>* Previously it only accepted a `DataValue` parameter<br><br>If you were using custom data value listeners, update your lambda expressions or anonymous classes:<br><br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    // Old API<br>    item.setDataValueListener(dataValue -> processValue(dataValue));<br>    <br>    // New API (Milo 1.0.5)<br>    item.setDataValueListener((monitoredItem, dataValue) -> processValue(dataValue)); | 未調査 |  |
| C013 | 4.15→4.16 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-flink | camel-flink | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-flink, flink:dataset, flink:datastream, map(), flatMap(), filter(), reduce(), keyBy().reduce(), groupBy(), keyBy(), join(), coGroup(), DataSetCallback, DataStreamCallback | Apache Flink deprecated the DataSet API in version 1.12 in favor of a unified DataStream API that handles both streaming and batch processing. The DataStream API with bounded streams provides all the functionality of the DataSet API and more, with better performance and a unified programming model. \|Aspect \|DataSet API \|DataStream API (Batch Mode) \|Execution \|Immediate (lazy evaluation) \|Event-driven (requires explicit execution) \|Data Type \|Bounded datasets \|Bounded or unbounded streams \|Time S |  | Apache Flink deprecated the DataSet API in version 1.12 in favor of a unified DataStream API that handles both<br>streaming and batch processing. The DataStream API with bounded streams provides all the functionality of the<br>DataSet API and more, with better performance and a unified programming model.<br><br>## Key Differences<br><br>[cols="1,1,1", options="header"]<br>\|===<br>\|Aspect \|DataSet API \|DataStream API (Batch Mode)<br><br>\|Execution<br>\|Immediate (lazy evaluation)<br>\|Event-driven (requires explicit execution)<br><br>\|Data Type<br>\|Bounded datasets<br>\|Bounded or unbounded streams<br><br>\|Time Semantics<br>\|Not applicable<br>\|Event time, processing time, ingestion time<br><br>\|State Management<br>\|Limited<br>\|Full support for keyed and operator state<br><br>\|Windowing<br>\|Not applicable<br>\|Full windowing support<br>\|===<br><br>## Migration Guide<br><br>===== Update Endpoint Type<br><br>Replace `flink:dataset` with `flink:datastream`:<br><br>._Java-only: Old flink DataSet endpoint_<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    from("direct:start")<br>        .to("flink:dataset?dataSet=#myDataSet&dataSetCallback=#myCallback");<br><br>._Java-only: New flink DataStream endpoint_<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    from("direct:start")<br>        .to("flink:datastream?dataStream=#myDataStream&dataStreamCallback=#myCallback");<br><br>===== Configure Batch Execution Mode<br><br>For batch processing with DataStream API, configure the execution environment for batch mode:<br><br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    StreamExecutionEnvironment env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();<br>    // Set to batch mode for bounded streams<br>    env.setRuntimeMode(RuntimeExecutionMode.BATCH);<br><br>===== Update Data Sources<br><br>.Before (DataSet API)<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    ExecutionEnvironment env = ExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();<br>    DataSet<String> dataSet = env.readTextFile("input.txt");<br><br>.After (DataStream API)<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    StreamExecutionEnvironment env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.getExecutionEnvironment();<br>    env.setRuntimeMode(RuntimeExecutionMode.BATCH);<br>    DataStream<String> dataStream = env.readTextFile("input.txt");<br><br>===== Update Transformations<br><br>Most transformation operations have direct equivalents:<br><br>[cols="1,1", options="header"]<br>\|===<br>\|DataSet API \|DataStream API<br><br>\|`map()`<br>\|`map()`<br><br>\|`flatMap()`<br>\|`flatMap()`<br><br>\|`filter()`<br>\|`filter()`<br><br>\|`reduce()`<br>\|`reduce()` or `keyBy().reduce()`<br><br>\|`groupBy()`<br>\|`keyBy()`<br><br>\|`join()`<br>\|`join()` (with windowing)<br><br>\|`coGroup()`<br>\|`coGroup()` (with windowing)<br>\|===<br><br>===== Update Callbacks<br><br>Replace `DataSetCallback` with `DataStreamCallback`:<br><br>.Before (DataSet)<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    @Bean<br>    public DataSetCallback<Long> dataSetCallback() {<br>        return new DataSetCallback<Long>() {<br>            public Long onDataSet(DataSet dataSet, Object... objects) {<br>                try {<br>                    return dataSet.count();<br>                } catch (Exception e) {<br>                    return -1L;<br>                }<br>            }<br>        };<br>    }<br><br>.After (DataStream)<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    @Bean<br>    public DataStreamCallback dataStreamCallback() {<br>        return new DataStreamCallback() {<br>            public Object onDataStream(DataStream dataStream, Object... objects) {<br>                // For batch mode, ensure runtime mode is set<br>                dataStream.print();<br>                return null;<br>            }<br>        };<br>    }<br><br>NOTE: Most users will not be affected by these changes as they primarily affect advanced use cases where you directly interact with the Milo API. Standard camel-milo endpoint configurations remain unchanged. | 未調査 |  |
| C014 | 4.16→4.17 | マイナー | 高 | オプション/クラス/API名・形式の変更 | camel-core | camel-core | 旧名称(オプション名・クラス名・ヘッダー名・XML/YAML属性)を grep し、新名称へ置換。XML/YAML DSL は属性形式の変更もあるため route ファイルも対象 | camel-core, transform, transformDataType, DefaultMessage, populateInitialHeaders | The `transform` EIP has moved the data-type function to a new specialized `transformDataType` EIP that works across all DSLs (Java, XML and YAML). For Java DSL that means code should be changed ._Java-only: Old transform with DataType_ to: ._Java-only: New transformDataType EIP_ Custom components which has a custom message implementation by extending `DefaultMessage`, which rely on the `populateInitialHeaders` to initialize headers must now add the following method: | あり | The `transform` EIP has moved the data-type function to a new specialized `transformDataType` EIP that<br>works across all DSLs (Java, XML and YAML).<br><br>For Java DSL that means code should be changed<br><br>._Java-only: Old transform with DataType_<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    from("direct:start")<br>        .transform(new DataType("myDataType"))<br>        .to("mock:result");<br><br>to:<br><br>._Java-only: New transformDataType EIP_<br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>    from("direct:start")<br>        .transformDataType(new DataType("myDataType"))<br>        .to("mock:result");<br><br>## Custom Camel components<br><br>Custom components which has a custom message implementation by extending `DefaultMessage`, which rely on the `populateInitialHeaders`<br>to initialize headers must now add the following method:<br><br>[source,java]<br>[code]<br>        @Override<br>        protected boolean isPopulateHeadersSupported() {<br>            return true;<br>        } | 未調査 |  |
| C015 | 4.16→4.17 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-cluster | camel-cluster | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-cluster | The cluster locking components has been made more tooling friendly for configuration by exposing all their options as metadata. - camel-file - camel-consul - camel-infinispan - camel-jgroups-kraft - camel-kubernetes - camel-master - camel-zookeeper |  | The cluster locking components has been made more tooling friendly for configuration by exposing all their options as metadata.<br><br>- camel-file<br>- camel-consul<br>- camel-infinispan<br>- camel-jgroups-kraft<br>- camel-kubernetes<br>- camel-master<br>- camel-zookeeper | 未調査 |  |
| C016 | 4.16→4.17 | マイナー | 中 | 非推奨 | camel-jbang | camel-jbang | 使用有無を grep。今回の更新では動く想定だが、次回以降の削除に備えて代替先を確認 | camel-jbang, camel-kamelets-catalog, -Dcamel-kamelets.version, camel-kamelets | The `camel-kamelets-catalog` JAR is now downloaded on-demand. The version of the Kamelets is now specified via `--kamelets-version` option (or via maven dependencies). The following option is no longer in use `-Dcamel-kamelets.version`. Removed automatic fallback to download Kamelet YAML files from GitHub. Instead, kamelets are now only loaded from embedded `camel-kamelets` JAR. Exporting with `--build-tools=gradle` is deprecated. Only Maven is and will be supported with camel-jbang. | あり | The `camel-kamelets-catalog` JAR is now downloaded on-demand.<br>The version of the Kamelets is now specified via `--kamelets-version` option (or via maven dependencies).<br>The following option is no longer in use `-Dcamel-kamelets.version`.<br><br>Removed automatic fallback to download Kamelet YAML files from GitHub. Instead, kamelets are<br>now only loaded from embedded `camel-kamelets` JAR.<br><br>Exporting with `--build-tools=gradle` is deprecated. Only Maven is and will be supported with camel-jbang. | 未調査 |  |
| C017 | 4.16→4.17 | マイナー | 低 | 追加/機能拡張・ライブラリ更新(参考) | camel-debezium | camel-debezium | 参考情報。ただしライブラリのメジャー更新を含む場合は原文で破壊的変更の有無を確認 | camel-debezium, camel-debezium | The `camel-debezium` component has upgraded from Debezium 3.3.2 to 3.4.0. | あり | The `camel-debezium` component has upgraded from Debezium 3.3.2 to 3.4.0. | 未調査 |  |
| C018 | 4.16→4.17 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-ftp | camel-ftp | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-ftp, camel-ftp | Add producer health check to `camel-ftp`. Notice that producer health checks are default globally off. If you have enabled producer health checks globally, then you can turn off this on `camel-ftp` component to not use the newly introduced checks in `camel-ftp` to have same behavior as previously. | あり | Add producer health check to `camel-ftp`. Notice that producer health checks are default globally off.<br><br>If you have enabled producer health checks globally, then you can turn off this on `camel-ftp` component<br>to not use the newly introduced checks in `camel-ftp` to have same behavior as previously. | 未調査 |  |
| C019 | 4.16→4.17 | マイナー | 中 | 既定値変更 | camel-infinispan | camel-infinispan | 該当オプションを明示指定しているか確認。未指定なら新既定値で動作が変わるため、旧値を明示するか挙動を検証 | camel-infinispan, camel-infinispan, camel-infinispan-embedded, infinispan-embedded, org.infinispan.threads.virtual, false | `camel-infinispan` has been upgraded to Infinispan 16. Virtual threads are enabled by default for embedded mode with `camel-infinispan-embedded`. If you choose to listen for cache events on the `infinispan-embedded` consumer, it is possible that events are not processed in a predictable order. Disabling virtual threads by setting system property `org.infinispan.threads.virtual` to `false` leads to more predictable event order processing. | あり | `camel-infinispan` has been upgraded to https://infinispan.org/blog/2025/11/10/infinispan-16-0[Infinispan 16].<br>Virtual threads are enabled by default for embedded mode with `camel-infinispan-embedded`.<br><br>If you choose to listen for cache events on the `infinispan-embedded` consumer, it is possible that events are not processed in a predictable order.<br>Disabling virtual threads by setting system property `org.infinispan.threads.virtual` to `false` leads to more predictable event order processing. | 未調査 |  |
