tionId()`<br>* `issueTypeId()` -> `jiraIssueTypeId()`<br>* `issueTypeName()` -> `jiraIssueTypeName()`<br>* `issueWatchedIssues()` -> `jiraIssueWatchedIssues()`<br>* `issueWatchersAdd()` -> `jiraIssueWatchersAdd()`<br>* `issueWatchersRemove()` -> `jiraIssueWatchersRemove()`<br>* `parentIssueKey()` -> `jiraParentIssueKey()`<br>* `childIssueKey()` -> `jiraChildIssueKey()`<br>* `linkType()` -> `jiraLinkType()`<br>* `minutesSpent()` -> `jiraMinutesSpent()` | 未調査 |  |
