| C188 | 4.20→4.21 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-docling | camel-docling | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-docling, EXTRACT_METADATA, title, documentType, DocumentMetadata, CamelDoclingMetadataTitle, CamelDoclingMetadataDocumentType | The `EXTRACT_METADATA` operation now populates the `title` and `documentType` fields on the returned `DocumentMetadata` (and the corresponding `CamelDoclingMetadataTitle` and `CamelDoclingMetadataDocumentType` headers) when the information can be determined from the document. The title is taken from the document title detected by Docling, and the document type is derived from the source file extension or MIME type. Previously these two fields were always empty. | あり | The `EXTRACT_METADATA` operation now populates the `title` and `documentType` fields on the returned<br>`DocumentMetadata` (and the corresponding `CamelDoclingMetadataTitle` and `CamelDoclingMetadataDocumentType`<br>headers) when the information can be determined from the document. The title is taken from the document title<br>detected by Docling, and the document type is derived from the source file extension or MIME type. Previously<br>these two fields were always empty. | 未調査 |  |
