| C312 | 4.21→4.22 | マイナー | 中 | 挙動変更 | camel-pinecone | camel-pinecone | 該当コンポーネント/EIPの使用箇所を grep し、原文の挙動差分が自システムに影響するか確認 | camel-pinecone, tls, false, true | The `tls` endpoint option now correctly documents its default as `false` (previously the catalog listed the default as `true`, but the runtime value was always `false`). No behavioral change — the runtime default was already `false`. |  | The `tls` endpoint option now correctly documents its default as `false` (previously the catalog<br>listed the default as `true`, but the runtime value was always `false`). No behavioral change — the<br>runtime default was already `false`. | 未調査 |  |
| C313 | 4.21→4.22 | マイナー | 高 | セキュリティ強化(挙動変更) | camel-platform-http-main | camel-platform-http-main | 該当コンポーネントを使用しているか grep。使用していれば、拒否される入力・必要な追加オプションがないか原文で確認し、結合テストで検証 | camel-platform-http-main, authenticationEnabled=true, basicPropertiesFile, jwtKeystoreType, prod, camel.main.profile=prod, dev | When `authenticationEnabled=true` but neither a basic-auth properties file (`basicPropertiesFile`) nor a JWT keystore (`jwtKeystoreType`) is configured, Camel now behaves differently under the `prod` profile (`camel.main.profile=prod`). Under the `prod` profile, startup now fails instead of starting the embedded HTTP server without authentication. Under the `dev` profile and with no profile configured, the existing warning-only behavior is retained for backward compatibility. | あり | When `authenticationEnabled=true` but neither a basic-auth properties file<br>(`basicPropertiesFile`) nor a JWT keystore (`jwtKeystoreType`) is configured,<br>Camel now behaves differently under the `prod` profile<br>(`camel.main.profile=prod`).<br><br>Under the `prod` profile, startup now fails instead of starting the embedded<br>HTTP server without authentication. Under the `dev` profile and with no profile<br>configured, the existing warning-only behavior is retained for backward<br>compatibility. | 未調査 |  |
